👑🧠 Birbal and the Weight of Smoke (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar asked Birbal a strange question.

“Can you measure the weight of smoke?” he asked.

The courtiers laughed. “That is impossible!”

But Birbal said, “Yes, I can do it.”

He brought a piece of wood and weighed it carefully.

Then he burned the wood and collected the ash.

He weighed the ash again.

Then Birbal said, “The difference in weight is the weight of the smoke.”

Akbar smiled at Birbal’s clever answer.

💖 Moral:

With clever thinking, even difficult problems can be solved
